>
>When writing on blank scrolls with a magic marker, does one write, for example,
>"identify" or, depending what the scroll is in that game, "TEMOV"?  Or does it
>matter?  Also, should the blank scroll be blessed or the marker be blessed - 
>or again, can it work either way?

Could be a spoiler here...let's see if my ctl-L works :)


You would write "identify" (at least I always have...)
Keep in mind that you must have discovered that type of scroll previously.
If the scroll is blessed, the new scroll will be too...unless your magic
marker is cursed, in which case it will be uncursed (they cancel).  A blessed
magic marker will uncurse a cursed scroll of blank paper, but I don't think it
will make an uncursed scroll blessed.
I usually use an altar to get my balnk paper to group, then bless 'em all
with but one application of holy water.
